"/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, February to March came in under 90% of normal in 39 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 28% of normal in November to December and 38% in March to April. Grid 8896 had its driest year in 2000, at 54% of normal.</p>"}
